WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.253
- Oh God, I don't know. What
am I doing between scenes?

00:00:02.253 --> 00:00:03.392
- [Candace] I know.

00:00:03.392 --> 00:00:05.092
- [Andrea] Keeping this PG, by the way.

00:00:05.092 --> 00:00:07.463
- What am I doing that's
not PG between scenes?

00:00:16.713 --> 00:00:17.838
- Pretty much.

00:00:17.838 --> 00:00:18.709
- [Jodie] Yea.

00:00:18.709 --> 00:00:20.324
- [Andrea] All phone related.

00:00:20.324 --> 00:00:21.347
- [Candace] Totally.

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:28.685
- [Andrea] "Running,
pooping, and knitting."

00:00:28.685 --> 00:00:31.623
- [Candace] We like poop conversations.

00:00:37.845 --> 00:00:40.834
- It's so true. She is on
her own planet of dance.

00:00:40.834 --> 00:00:43.366
- The electric slide doesn't
count as a dance move.

00:00:43.366 --> 00:00:45.478
That's not dancing.

00:00:53.079 --> 00:00:55.171
- [Candace] I like your answer.

00:00:55.171 --> 00:00:57.056
Cause we all laugh a lot.

00:01:03.524 --> 00:01:05.928
Oh. Okay.

00:01:05.928 --> 00:01:06.609
- [Andrea] Well, it's just cause

00:01:06.609 --> 00:01:08.778
you have the most experience.
You have the oldest kids.

00:01:08.778 --> 00:01:09.722
- [Candace] Well, this is true.

00:01:09.722 --> 00:01:11.881
- I've gotten advice from you in the past.

00:01:11.881 --> 00:01:14.613
- Okay, thanks. Well I think
you two are pretty great moms.

00:01:14.613 --> 00:01:15.801
- [Jodie and Andrea] Aww.

00:01:23.365 --> 00:01:25.110
- [Andrea] It's true. Jodie's is the most-

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:26.754
- [Candace] Yours is the most accurate.

00:01:26.754 --> 00:01:28.691
We love the '90s.

00:01:28.691 --> 00:01:30.396
- [Andrea] We had these
20 year old choreographers

00:01:30.396 --> 00:01:31.953
teaching us the moves to The Right Stuff

00:01:31.953 --> 00:01:33.694
and we're like, um,
that's not how it's done.

00:01:33.694 --> 00:01:34.751
Let us tell you

00:01:34.751 --> 00:01:36.956
how to do the New Kids on
the Block choreography,

00:01:36.956 --> 00:01:38.407
cause we know.

00:01:43.761 --> 00:01:45.067
- [Andrea] "None of us- he's our uncle!'

00:01:45.067 --> 00:01:47.308
"None of us. Bob Saget."

00:01:47.308 --> 00:01:48.963
- [Candace] "None of the above. Ew."

00:01:48.963 --> 00:01:50.333
- [Jodie] Ew, yeah. (laughs)

00:01:51.235 --> 00:01:52.815
- [Jodie] We're probably
the only three women

00:01:52.815 --> 00:01:53.892
on the planet that don't.

00:01:53.892 --> 00:01:54.861
- [Candace] You know Bob though.

00:01:54.861 --> 00:01:56.545
- [Andrea] Don't have anything for him.

